# Maps every identity a contributor has committed under to one name and
# address, so `git shortlog`, `git log` and blame show each person once.
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> <address used in commits>
# This changes how git displays history; it does not rewrite any commit.

# Rafli (raf-li): committed as raf-li, Rafli, Raf-li, rafli, Umiko and unknown.
Rafli <93827765+raf-li@users.noreply.github.com>
Rafli <93827765+raf-li@users.noreply.github.com> <rafli08523717409@gmail.com>
# A mistyped `git config user.email` joined the address with the tutorial
# placeholder "you@example.com".
Rafli <93827765+raf-li@users.noreply.github.com> <rafli08523717409@gmail.com"you@example.com>

# Rexya (rexya2017): committed as rexya and Rexya.
